> ** Note on CNN Preprocessed Data**
> 
> The CNN preprocessed files (`CNN_X_train.npy` and `CNN_X_test.npy`) are not included
> in this repository because they exceed GitHub's 100MB file size limit. These files are
> simply the raw Fashion-MNIST pixel values normalized to [0, 1], which are reproduced
> automatically when the notebook is run via torchvision.
> 
> The uploaded preprocessed files represent the KNN and SVM pipeline specifically — the
> stratified subset after PCA dimensionality reduction (784 → 100 features) — which is
> the meaningful preprocessing work for those models.
